  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: "You grew up in the kitchens of a tavern or other dining establishment
    and excelled there, becoming an exceptional cook. Baking, cooking, a little brewing
    on the side\u2014you've spent lots of time out of sight. It's about time you
    went out into the world to catch some sights for yourself. Choose two attribute
    boosts. One must be to Constitution or Intelligence , and one is a free attribute
    boost. You're trained in the Survival skill and the Cooking Lore skill. You gain
    the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Seasoned] skill feat."
